{"parse": {"title": "LPdF-03", "pageid": 114317, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LPdF-02\" title=\"LPdF-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LPdF-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/LPdF-04\" title=\"LPdF-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LPdF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.A3.8E.E5.B8.86.E9.87.8C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"风帆里\">风帆里</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 风帆里</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Free Falling</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>诗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>说<span class=\"color-value\"></span>：<span class=\"color-value\"></span>抬<span class=\"color-value\"></span>起<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>眼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>睛<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>仰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>望<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>永<span class=\"color-value\"></span>恒<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>穹<span class=\"color-value\"></span>顶<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 30510103</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_01\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-s01_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-s01_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-s01_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>初次见面，这位……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>艾吉奥·奥迪托雷。你可以叫我艾吉奥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>晚上好，艾吉奥先生。APPLe某是一位来自远方的……咳，游客。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾吉奥点点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>事实上，我和小偷公会的朋友们已经跟踪你有一段时间了。你的基本情况我们已经大致了解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>跟踪我……？APPLe某对此难以置信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>放心吧，大部分时间你都在酣睡——除了偶尔的梦话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>我想莱昂纳多已经告诉你前因后果了。还有什么地方不太明白吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>全部！这些……圣殿骑士、晚祷会、湿壁画，还有解剖！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不满的控诉声飘向远方，又被风轻轻吹散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>他们试图将APPLe某切成四瓣，然后泡进什么试剂里……真是一个野蛮的时代！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>圣殿骑士是刺客的敌人，如果你想知道的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>我们之间的战争已经持续了很多年，从未停止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>哦，你们还能坐下来好好谈谈吗？暴力或许能解决暂时的矛盾，但长久而言并无益处……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>很遗憾，不能。已经有太多人因圣殿骑士不断膨胀的野心而丧命，甚至包括……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刺客停顿了一瞬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>不论如何，我同意你的观点——长久而言，暴力并无益处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>所以我会尽快终结他们的性命，避免无谓的牺牲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他将右手放至胸前，朝APPLe轻轻鞠了一躬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>很抱歉让你卷入了这场纷争，苹果先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>我们不能坐视圣殿骑士得到晚祷会的遗物，因此你的立场很重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>嗯……刚才那位莱昂纳多先生，你们似乎是好友对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这似乎是一个与当前谈话无关的问题。刺客迟疑地点点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>是的。早在我17岁的时候我们便认识了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>原来如此。那我相信你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苹果轻咳一声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我模糊的历史印——噢，不，直觉告诉我，那位莱昂纳多先生是个好人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>既然你跟他是好友，那么你大概也是位有信用的先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刺客笑了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>看来，说服你比我想的要简单很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>不过出发前，APPLe某还有一个小小的请求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>请尽管告诉我。我们之间需要坦诚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>事实上，APPLe某并非独自一人……还有几个朋友，我们在前往佛罗伦萨旅行的途中走散了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>作为交换，能否请你帮忙找到APPLe某走失的朋友们，并为我们提供庇护？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>毕竟这是个有些……与众不同的地方，我们作为外来者，多少需要一些保障。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>没问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>哦，太好了！您是位爽快的先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>你愿意协助，我们已经感激不尽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>很高兴APPLe某能在这里派上用场。虽然船长可能会颇有微词……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>不过我还是得说，APPLe某从未受过如此重视！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>没人是无足轻重的。真正改变世界的，往往是那些被忽视的角落里的小人物，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刺客微笑着向APPLe伸出手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>那就算达成协议了？我们团结一致。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>落日的余晖洒在他们身上。受到鼓舞的APPLe回握住艾吉奥的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">团结一致！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>接下来，我计划去工作室和莱昂纳多会合。准备好了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>准备？哦，如果要去拜访莱昂纳多先生的工作室，确实应该准备一点像样的伴手礼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾吉奥走到屋顶边缘突出的脚手架上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他蹲下身，警惕地环顾下方熙熙攘攘的街道，像一只蓄势待发的鹰。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_cg_31.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_cg_31\"><img alt=\"s01_cg_31\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/Cg-s01_cg_31.png/600px-Cg-s01_cg_31.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/Cg-s01_cg_31.png/900px-Cg-s01_cg_31.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/Cg-s01_cg_31.png/1200px-Cg-s01_cg_31.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-312301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-312301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-312301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>我的意思是，从这里跳下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>这里？跳下去？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>不，APPLe某绝不同意……这是连船长都做不出的疯狂——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_cg_32.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_cg_32\"><img alt=\"s01_cg_32\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-s01_cg_32.png/600px-Cg-s01_cg_32.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-s01_cg_32.png/900px-Cg-s01_cg_32.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-s01_cg_32.png/1200px-Cg-s01_cg_32.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312314.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-312314.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312314.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312314.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-312314.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312314.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-312314.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312314.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>疯狂，但很高效。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_cg_02.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_cg_02\"><img alt=\"s01_cg_02\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/Cg-s01_cg_02.png/600px-Cg-s01_cg_02.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/Cg-s01_cg_02.png/900px-Cg-s01_cg_02.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/Cg-s01_cg_02.png/1200px-Cg-s01_cg_02.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>耳畔传来一阵阵风声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刺客捎带着金色的苹果穿过稀薄的雾气，几乎与灰羽的岩鸽并肩而行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>不——！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:116%\"><i>“砰！”</i></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>咳咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>四周弥漫着干燥蓬松的稻草气息，夹杂着灰尘与泥土的味道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们坠入一个装满干草的小车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>APPLe某现在感觉不太好。这应该是极短时间内缺氧导致的眩晕症状……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-312301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-312301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-312301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>嘘……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-312301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-312301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-312301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>安静，外面还有敌人。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhongshijijiedao_ye\"><img alt=\"zhongshijijiedao_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/600px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/900px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/1200px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜色降临，纷乱的脚步声透过草堆缝隙隐约传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">圣殿骑士长官：</div><div>嘿，那边戴蓝色帽子的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>四下一片寂静，草堆内外的数双耳朵都在静候“蓝色帽子”的回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>晚上好……先生。请问有什么事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-302810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>这个声音……哦，APPLe某此刻有一种非常好的预感～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>谈话仍在继续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">圣殿骑士长官：</div><div>穿得怪里怪气的，应该不是本地人。在这里做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>先生，我是来自远方的游客，如果需要身份证明的话——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑士不耐烦地摆了摆手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">圣殿骑士长官：</div><div>我们不是来查这个的。见过一个戴着灰色兜帽，个子很高的男人吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼神不经意扫过街角的干草车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>由小麦和苜蓿堆成的小山安稳地立在车上，不会有任何人质疑它的平庸与无害。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>抱歉，我没太留意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-636301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-636301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-636301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">圣殿骑士Ⅲ：</div><div>没看到人，那别的东西呢？比如一个……呃，金色的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑士笨拙地在空气中比划了一个圆弧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">圣殿骑士长官：</div><div>算了，她什么也不知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">圣殿骑士长官：</div><div>我们走！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉重步伐伴随金属碰撞的回音渐渐远去，最后消失在夜色里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又过了一会儿，另一个脚步声不紧不慢地响起，最后停在孤零零的干草车旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>没有受伤吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>草堆轻轻抖动着，仿佛在酝酿一场未曾预料的邂逅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>维尔汀！想不到再次相遇是在这样尴尬的场合……请给APPLe某两分钟清理一下身上的碎屑……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我听到了一些关于“金苹果”的传闻，又看见不少人朝着这附近赶来，所以过来试试运气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>没想到真的是你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>为什么要从那么高的地方跳下来？这很危险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>呃，这是一个复杂的故事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>晚上好，女士。刚才的掩护真是令人印象深刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>这就是你提及的那位友人吗，苹果先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>没错！不过据APPLe某所知，前来旅行的朋友应该不止她一个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这位先生是你的新朋友吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>艾吉奥·奥迪托雷，一位货真价实的刺客！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>刺客？听上去是一份很危险的职业。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>请不要被这个名字误导了。在我们的组织里，刺杀并非目的，而是手段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>马上就要宵禁了，这里不是适合停留的地方，我们可以边走边谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>毕竟，我那位老朋友恐怕已经等得不耐烦了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LPdF-03"}}